mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 956px; width: 100%;" border="1">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 54px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第1周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 54px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>绪论、概况介绍</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 54px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">
<p><strong>2学时，</strong><strong>学生将了解医工交叉在眼科领域的基本概念、主要研究方向和应用价值，并通过典型案例建立对眼科创新诊疗技术的整体认识，激发学习兴趣。</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第2周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>干眼物理治疗设备研发与应用</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">
<p><strong>3学时，</strong><strong>学生将了解干眼症的病理机制与物理治疗原理，掌握常见干眼物理治疗设备（如强脉冲光、热脉动等）的技术特点与临床适应症，初步建立医工结合思维，能够从临床需求出发分析设备研发的关键环节。</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第3周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>视网膜和中枢视觉系统</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">
<p><strong>3学时，</strong><strong>生将了解视网膜和视觉中枢的损伤修复原理，认识人工视觉假体、基因治疗等前沿技术如何帮助视觉重建，并通过案例理解这些技术在临床中的应用前景。</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第4周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>AI辅助的近视屈光手术</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">
<p><strong>3学时，</strong><strong>通过本次课程，学生将了解AI在近视手术规划、风险评估和术后预测中的作用，认识常见AI辅助手术设备的基本原理，并能结合案例理解AI如何提升屈光手术的安全性和精准性。</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 54px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第5周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 54px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>视网膜手术小工具的设计与使用</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 54px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">
<p><strong>3学时，</strong><strong>通过本次课程，学生将了解视网膜手术的基本操作难点，认识常用手术器械的设计原理，并能分析创新工具如何优化手术流程、提高手术安全性。</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第6周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>眼眶疾病医工交叉创新研究</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">
<p><strong>3学时，</strong><strong>通过本次课程，学生将了解常见眼眶疾病的诊疗难点，认识影像导航、3D打印等工程技术在眼眶手术中的应用，并通过案例分析理解医工结合如何提升眼眶疾病诊治水平</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 22px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%"><strong>第7周</strong></td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 22px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%"><strong>AI辅助的近视精准防控(示教课)</strong></td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 22px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%"><strong>3学时，</strong><strong>通过本次课程，学生将了解AI如何帮助筛查近视和预测近视发展，认识常见的AI近视防控工具，并能结合临床案例理解AI技术在近视防控中的实际应用。</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第8周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>从机制研究到临床转化:可穿戴眼科设备研发实践</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">
<p><strong>3学时，</strong><strong>通过本次课程，学生将了解眼科基础研究如何转化为临床应用，认识从实验室到病床的关键环节，并通过实际案例理解转化医学在眼科发展中的重要性。</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第9周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>裸眼3D在眼科中的应用</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">
<p><strong>3学时，</strong><strong>通过本次课程，学生将了解裸眼3D技术的基本原理，掌握该技术在眼科疾病诊断（如立体视功能评估）、手术导航（如显微镜系统）等场景中的具体应用，并能举例说明其临床优势。</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第11周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>生物医用纳米材料用于眼科疾病的药物递送</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">
<p><strong>3学时，</strong><strong>学生将了解眼科药物递送的特殊挑战（如血眼屏障），认识纳米载体、缓释植入剂等新型递送技术的特点，并能通过案例比较不同给药方式的临床适用性。</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第12周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>眼压调控的生理机制与智能干预</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">
<p><strong>3学时，</strong><strong>学生将理解眼压调控的基本生理机制（如房水循环），认识智能传感技术与靶向治疗在眼压管理中的应用，并能通过青光眼案例讨论智能干预的临床价值。</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第13周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>血液标志物与眼病防控</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 76px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">
<p><strong>3学时，</strong><strong>学生将了解常见眼病相关的血液标志物检测原理，认识AI如何分析这些标志物来预测和评估眼病风险，并通过典型案例理解AI辅助诊断在眼科临床中的应用价值。</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 54px; width: 12.92%;" width="12.9200%">
<p><strong>第14周</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 54px; width: 25.52%;" width="25.5200%">
<p><strong>考试、批卷阅卷、登分</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 54px; width: 61.56%;" width="61.5600%">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
